---
name: spinner
type: registry:ui
title: Spinner
description: A loading indicator that spins an icon with accessible status semantics.
dependencies:
  - "@lucide/svelte"
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/spinner/spinner.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/spinner/spinner.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/spinner/spinner.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/spinner/spinner.types.ts"
---

Use the spinner to show that a section or action is loading. Pass `class` to change size or color.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import Spinner from '~/components/spinner/spinner.svelte';
</script>

<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
	<Spinner />
	<Spinner class="size-5" />
	<Spinner class="size-6 text-muted-foreground" />
</div>
```
